
<section class="hero-veil">
  <div class="wrap hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1>高端二手水晶回收</h1>
      <p>上載相片、選擇種類與狀況，<br class="hide-sm">即時獲得<b>參考回收價</b>。流程透明、估價審慎、付款快捷。</p>
      <div class="badges">
        <span>專員鑑定</span><span>快速報價</span><span>保密處理</span>
      </div>
      <a class="cta" href="#get-offer">開始估價</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-card">
      <div class="gem"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how-it-works" class="wrap section">
  <h2>流程</h2>
  <div class="steps-grid">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="num">1</div>
      <h3>提交資料</h3>
      <p>上載相片，填寫品類、重量、狀況與尺寸。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="num">2</div>
      <h3>初步報價</h3>
      <p>系統即時給出參考價，專員 1–2 個工作天內聯絡確認。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="num">3</div>
      <h3>專業檢驗</h3>
      <p>放大鏡檢瑕疵、折射/硬度比對，核對證書與配件。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="num">4</div>
      <h3>快速收款</h3>
      <p>轉數快 / 銀行轉帳即時到賬；不成交可原件退回。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="get-offer" class="wrap section card luxe">
  <div class="form-head">
    <h2>即時估價</h2>
    <p class="muted">結果僅供參考，最終以專員檢驗為準。</p>
  </div>
  <form id="quote-form" action="/quote" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">
    <% if (typeof errors !== 'undefined') { %>
      <div class="alert">
        <ul><% errors.forEach(e => { %><li><%= e.msg %></li><% }) %></ul>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="grid-2">
      <div>
        <label>姓名*</label>
        <input name="name" required>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>聯絡電郵*</label>
        <input name="email" type="email" required>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-3">
      <div>
        <label>水晶種類*</label>
        <select name="type" id="type" required>
          <option value="amethyst">紫水晶 Amethyst</option>
          <option value="rose_quartz">粉晶 Rose Quartz</option>
          <option value="clear_quartz">白水晶 Clear Quartz</option>
          <option value="citrine">黃水晶 Citrine</option>
          <option value="black_onyx">黑瑪瑙 Black Onyx</option>
          <option value="aquamarine">海藍寶 Aquamarine</option>
          <option value="jade">玉 Jade</option>
          <option value="tourmaline">碧璽 Tourmaline</option>
          <option value="others">其他 Others</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>重量（克）</label>
        <input name="weight" id="weight" type="number" min="0" step="1" placeholder="如不確定可留空">
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>外觀狀況</label>
        <select name="condition" id="condition">
          <option value="mint">近全新</option>
          <option value="good" selected>良好</option>
          <option value="fair">一般</option>
          <option value="poor">明顯損耗</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-2">
      <div>
        <label>尺寸</label>
        <select name="size" id="size">
          <option value="xs">迷你</option>
          <option value="s">小</option>
          <option value="m" selected>中</option>
          <option value="l">大</option>
          <option value="xl">特大</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>電話 / WhatsApp</label>
        <input name="phone" placeholder="+852 9xxxxxxx">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <label>上載相片（最多 5 張，JPG/PNG/WEBP/GIF）</label>
      <input type="file" name="photos" accept="image/*" multiple>
    </div>

    <div>
      <label>備註</label>
      <textarea name="notes" rows="4" placeholder="例如：購買年份、是否有裂紋/棉絮、配件等"></textarea>
    </div>

    <div class="estimate luxe-est">
      <div>
        <div class="est-label">即時參考回收價</div>
        <div class="est-value"><span id="estPrice">$0</span> HKD</div>
      </div>
      <button class="cta" type="submit">提交估價申請</button>
    </div>
  </form>
</section>

<section id="faqs" class="wrap section">
  <h2>常見問題</h2>
  <div class="faq">
    <details>
      <summary>參考價與最終價會差很多嗎？</summary>
      <p>一般情況差距不大；若有隱性裂紋、處理色、嚴重磨損等，會影響最終價格。</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>沒有磅重怎麼辦？</summary>
      <p>可先選擇尺寸與狀況，我們仍可給出參考價；最終以檢驗為準。</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>付款方式？</summary>
      <p>轉數快 / 銀行轉帳即時到賬。不成交可原件退回。</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>哪些品類更保值？</summary>
      <p>碧璽、玉、海藍寶等相對保值；普通白水晶、粉晶則以狀況為主。</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
